  - `chunkId`: `old-school-essentials-basic-rules-v1-4-a4d9608ea98b:s191:n0`
  - URL: `https://joelclaw.com/api/docs/chunks/old-school-essentials-basic-rules-v1-4-a4d9608ea98b:s191:n0?lite=true&includeEmbedding=false`

